The sampled non-iterator helpers match this smoke test, so the issue is specifically `Buffer` iteration.

## Expected

- `Array.from(Buffer.from("hello").keys())` returns `[0, 1, 2, 3, 4]`.
- `Array.from(Buffer.from("hello").values())` returns `[104, 101, 108, 108, 111]`.
- `Array.from(Buffer.from("hello").entries())` returns index/value pairs.
- `for...of Buffer.from("hello")` follows the same value iteration as `values()`.
